WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:03.600 --> 00:00:05.360
Thirty-plus years of service.

00:00:09.620 --> 00:00:10.900
Combat medals.

00:00:11.160 --> 00:00:12.040
Citations.

00:00:12.500 --> 00:00:15.960
Only man to shoot down three enemy planes in the last forty years.

00:00:20.360 --> 00:00:21.940
Yet, you can't get a promotion...

00:00:22.340 --> 00:00:23.240
...you won't retire...

00:00:23.600 --> 00:00:26.040
...and despite your best efforts, you refuse to die.

00:00:39.420 --> 00:00:42.180
You should be, at least, a two-star admiral by now.

00:00:42.840 --> 00:00:44.100
Yet here you are...

00:00:45.560 --> 00:00:46.060
Captain.

00:00:47.880 --> 00:00:48.380
Why is that?

00:00:51.880 --> 00:00:53.200
It's one of life's mysteries, sir.

00:01:48.600 --> 00:01:50.340
The end is inevitable, Maverick.

00:01:50.560 --> 00:01:51.060
Your kind is headed for extinction.

00:01:53.880 --> 00:01:54.620
Maybe so, sir.

00:01:57.120 --> 00:01:57.800
But not today.

